DEF("system:anti_wrap",
    S4(A("CONS"), K(A("COMP")),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:AntiRestrict"), N(3)),
       S4(A("CONS"), K(A("CONS")), N(1), N(2)))),

"THE STRATIFIED-NEGATION RULE BUILDER (2026-07-10, #18 rule_if): system:compile_rule_neg — the positive body wrapped in anti-joins, the canonical form of engine.compile_rule_neg (the host stays the certified-equal twin). Operand ⟨atoms, head, bodyhead, filters, negs⟩: atoms in the shared ⟨ft, width, join?⟩ encoding (widths and joins fold into the spec, exactly _rule_atoms); head the projection over the surviving tuple (may carry ⟨CONST, lit⟩ entries); bodyhead the IDENTITY projection 1..ncols precomputed by the cook (Stage-1 resolves everything static; the base has no iota); filters the comparator data trees (theta:Filter consumes a sequence-form predicate directly — a function's representation IS a sequence); negs the group specs ⟨natoms, nproj, nfilters, ⟨anti_key, 1..|nproj|⟩⟩ — each group its own compile_rule over its own spec, anti-joined onto the running object through system:anti_wrap (theta:AntiRestrict — Restrict's mirror with the membership negated). The WHILE fold carries ⟨obj, remaining groups⟩ — group order preserved, the LAST group wraps outermost, exactly the host's loop; the head Project composes last. Full recompute above the closure, like aggregates: semi-naive deltas are unsound under negation-as-failure, so no ~d variant exists for this builder.",

DEF("system:compile_rule_neg",
    S4(A("CONS"), K(A("COMP")),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("apply"),
          S3(A("CONS"), K(A("theta:Project")), N(2))),
       S4(A("COMP"), N(1),
          S3(A("WHILE"),
             S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("null"), N(2)),
             S3(A("CONS"),
                S3(A("COMP"), A("apply"),
                   S3(A("CONS"), K(A("system:anti_wrap")),
                      S4(A("CONS"),
                         N(1),
                         S3(A("COMP"), A("apply"),
                            S3(A("CONS"), K(A("system:compile_rule")),
                               S4(A("CONS"),
                                  S4(A("COMP"), N(1), N(1), N(2)),
                                  S4(A("COMP"), N(2), N(1), N(2)),
                                  S4(A("COMP"), N(3), N(1), N(2))))),
                         S4(A("COMP"), N(4), N(1), N(2))))),
                S3(A("COMP"), A("tl"), N(2)))),
          S3(A("CONS"),
             S3(A("COMP"), A("apply"),
                S3(A("CONS"), K(A("system:compile_rule")),
                   S4(A("CONS"), N(1), N(3), N(4)))),
             N(5))))),

